WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
(mid-tempo bright music)

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.490
- [Narrator] In a remote part of Japan

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.290
lives a highly toxic
plant called the cycad.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.520
And, believe it or not,
people consume it regularly.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.171
Beloved and cherished by the
native people of Amami Ōshima,

00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:15.647
eating the plant in its
raw form could kill you.

00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:23.140
(mid-tempo upbeat music)

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.150
Amami Ōshima is home to to hundreds

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.940
of types of toxic plants.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.478
The cycad has been a staple crop

00:00:28.478 --> 00:00:30.670
on the island for generations.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.070
Because it is so poisonous,

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.575
locals take the necessary steps

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:36.223
to make the plant safe
for human consumption.

00:01:17.149 --> 00:01:19.530
- [Narrator] Through the process
of fermentation and drying,

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.583
the poison is extracted from the plant.

00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:27.539
(machine beeps)

00:01:42.289 --> 00:01:45.289
(slow gentle music)

00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:48.895
(slow tranquil music)

